   "attributes": {
    "name": "Party- Room 1 (Capacity-up to 30 people)",
    "desc": "Party can be reserved no more than 3 months in advance and no less than 3 days out. Please contact office manager for reservations within 3 days of party date.<br /><br />Birthday Party Package includes:<br />\n<ul>\n<li>10 Admissions</li>\n<li>10 Skate rentals</li>\n<li>2 XL Pizza (8 slices)</li>\n<li>10 drinks</li>\n<li>Set-up &amp; Clean-Up</li>\n<li>Benches, Tables &amp; Tablecloth</li>\n<li>Plates, Napkins, Utensils</li>\n<li>Invitations can be picked up at the rink</li>\n</ul>\nParty Buddy or One Time group must be requested at least 2 weeks in advance",
